<title>SINGAPORE: Director of Jack Chia-MPH resigns.</title>
<headline>Director of Jack Chia-MPH resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jack Chia-MPH Ltd said on Monday group managing director John Lim Kok Min had resigned.</p>
<p>Lim would be leaving on January 31 and be replaced by finance director Tan Choon Huat, a company statement said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
